Avoid the "Mysterious Force" Entirely

Let Orcus (or some other covetous monster) carry the amulet
out for you. I had the chance to do this with Demogorgon in
my last game, but thought him too dangerous. I did try it in
wizard mode for five or six levels. Once Demogorgon got
below about 30% of his HP, he'd scamper up that next set of
stairs as soon as he saw me coming.

With a covetous monster (probably has to be a named demon)
next to you, teleport to the bottom of the dungeon, leave it
there until you get the amulet. Give the monster the amulet.
Beat on it with some low damage weapon until it goes to the
stairs. Go beat on it some more until it escapes upstairs.
Repeat. You don't even have to map all of Gehennom since the
"mule" will always show you next set of stairs.
